WEBVTT

00:08.920 --> 00:10.790
I don't like the look of that storm...

00:10.790 --> 00:13.210
Yeah... We should find a place to wait it out.

00:24.000 --> 00:26.330
What happened? That was anticlimactic...

00:28.580 --> 00:30.080
It's a barrier...

00:30.080 --> 00:32.210
A remarkably powerful one, at that.

00:37.380 --> 00:42.130
Those talismans are what's
keeping you safe from the demons.

00:42.710 --> 00:45.170
You can tell by the fact
that we haven't had

00:45.170 --> 00:47.290
a single demon-related
casualty in the village.

00:47.290 --> 00:50.630
But new species have appeared as of late...

00:50.630 --> 00:52.960
It's important that we stay vigilant.

00:52.960 --> 00:57.380
Which is why we've taken the liberty of
creating brand new talismans!

00:57.380 --> 01:01.920
<b>Good Luck</b>

00:58.170 --> 01:01.920
Us clerics poured every ounce of our strength
into the ultimate protection tool!

01:02.380 --> 01:05.960
And for today only, we're offering them
at a special discounted price!

01:06.380 --> 01:07.380
I'll take one!

01:07.380 --> 01:08.290
Me, too!

01:08.290 --> 01:09.540
One for me, please!

01:09.540 --> 01:11.460
Okay, everyone calm down!

01:11.460 --> 01:14.130
If you want a blessing,
please form an orderly line!

01:15.420 --> 01:16.960
What's all the fuss about?
Now, our supplies are limited...<b></b>

01:16.960 --> 01:19.460
Demon-resistant talismans, eh?
Two talismans per customer!<b></b>

01:19.460 --> 01:22.460
We're already here.
Might as well buy one, right?
If you'd like to purchase more,<b>
</b>please write your order on this form!<b></b>

01:22.460 --> 01:23.250
If you'd like to purchase more,
please write your order on this form!

01:25.330 --> 01:27.460
How about it, folks?

01:27.460 --> 01:31.920
These tried-and-true talismans are guaranteed
to protect you in the event of a demon attack.

01:32.630 --> 01:34.210
Do they actually work?

01:34.210 --> 01:35.710
Of course they do!

01:35.710 --> 01:38.420
They're effective against
even the most powerful of demons.

01:38.420 --> 01:42.130
Just hold the talisman up like this,
and... abracadabra!

01:42.130 --> 01:45.580
They'll go running off with
their tails between their legs!

01:42.130 --> 01:45.580
<b>Good Luck</b>

01:46.130 --> 01:47.580
I smell a scam...

01:49.670 --> 01:51.880
If you have no business here,
then please leave.

01:52.170 --> 01:56.250
This is a holy place, and slovenly tourists
such as yourselves are-

02:36.710 --> 02:37.830
Get out of here!

02:37.830 --> 02:38.960
O-okay!

02:50.580 --> 02:53.790
The two of you are
no ordinary travelers, are you?

02:55.330 --> 02:58.130
And you're no ordinary cleric, either.

03:07.330 --> 03:08.960
Alright, let's do this!

03:18.580 --> 03:19.670
<b>Level 1 Demon Lord and One Room Hero</b>

04:45.750 --> 04:47.500
Take a look, Max.

04:45.920 --> 04:53.040
<b>#3 Fred the Cleric</b>

04:47.920 --> 04:49.330
What is it...?

04:49.750 --> 04:53.040
I was hoping to get your opinion
on the matter, if you don't mind.

04:53.330 --> 04:54.830
H-hold on, Max!

04:54.830 --> 04:56.830
I never meant for you to see any of that-

04:55.630 --> 04:56.830
<b>The series of events that led to</b>

04:55.630 --> 04:56.830
<b>Leo the Warrior's defection from the Kingdom</b>

04:55.630 --> 04:56.830
<b>Compiled by Zenia</b>

04:59.380 --> 05:00.960
This is bullshit...

05:07.420 --> 05:08.540
Max...

05:10.040 --> 05:13.080
What's the matter with Max
all of a sudden...?

05:13.080 --> 05:16.210
He's not a big fan of sharing his feelings.

05:16.540 --> 05:21.540
Plus, I'd imagine it's difficult for him to
talk about his former friend's defection...

05:16.540 --> 05:22.710
<b>The series of events that led to</b>

05:16.540 --> 05:22.710
<b>Leo the Warrior's defection</b>

05:31.040 --> 05:33.460
Maybe I'll hit up the peep show...

05:34.750 --> 05:36.080
Excuse me, sir.

05:37.170 --> 05:38.790
I'm a reporter with Free Day Magazine.

05:38.790 --> 05:40.460
You're Max, correct?

05:42.790 --> 05:45.290
Are you familiar with this video?

05:46.540 --> 05:49.290
The man being chased...
That's you, isn't it?

05:49.290 --> 05:50.380
Uh, yup.

05:50.380 --> 05:51.880
And who is this woman?

05:51.880 --> 05:53.040
A friend of mine.

05:53.040 --> 05:56.080
Really? JUST a friend?

05:56.080 --> 05:57.580
Yeah, well...

05:57.880 --> 06:01.290
When we met up for drinks,
she had a few too many, and...

06:01.290 --> 06:03.880
Just checking, but...
she's not a minor, is she?

06:03.880 --> 06:05.670
No! Of course not!

06:05.670 --> 06:06.920
I made EXTRA sure of that...

06:06.920 --> 06:09.710
And do the two of you have
a physical relationship?

06:09.710 --> 06:11.830
Oh, I wouldn't say that...

06:11.830 --> 06:13.670
'Cause she's, well, y'know...

06:13.670 --> 06:16.250
Uh, but no. It's nothing like that.

06:16.250 --> 06:19.080
How would you describe this woman, exactly?

06:19.080 --> 06:21.040
Er, whaddya mean...?

06:21.040 --> 06:22.580
Her line of work, for example.

06:22.580 --> 06:24.290
O-oh, right...

06:24.290 --> 06:27.580
Uh, I think she mentioned
working in an office...

06:27.580 --> 06:29.500
Sorry for takin' up yer time!

06:29.500 --> 06:30.920
I'll be on my way...

06:31.290 --> 06:32.710
One more question, Max!

06:33.170 --> 06:35.540
Any comment on the Gamma Republic's
illegal occupation

06:35.540 --> 06:39.710
of the Kingdom's northernmost territory,
led by Leo the Warrior?

06:59.080 --> 07:00.460
Let's follow him!

07:00.460 --> 07:02.830
We gotta find out his exact address...

07:02.830 --> 07:05.670
We have to be there the moment
that woman comes out of his house

07:05.670 --> 07:07.290
and catch him in the act!

07:07.290 --> 07:08.750
Sure thing...

07:11.750 --> 07:12.830
What?!

07:14.000 --> 07:16.290
But he definitely went this way, didn't he?!

07:16.290 --> 07:18.290
How in the hell...?!

07:19.170 --> 07:21.080
Wow, he swerved us real quick...

07:21.080 --> 07:22.580
Goddammit!

07:24.750 --> 07:26.250
Fantastic...

07:26.540 --> 07:28.710
Soaked my whole damn leg.

07:28.710 --> 07:30.330
Smooth move, Max...

07:30.880 --> 07:33.750
Can't believe someone recorded that shitshow...

07:33.750 --> 07:37.880
But on the bright side, it seems like
nobody suspects Zenia of bein' a demon...

07:38.210 --> 07:40.790
Can't even take a frickin' walk in peace...

07:49.920 --> 07:52.580
It would appear that he lives in this building.

07:52.580 --> 07:54.830
How pathetic...

07:54.830 --> 07:57.250
The man they once worshipped
as a mighty hero,

07:57.250 --> 08:00.330
living in a shabby dump of an apartment...

08:00.960 --> 08:01.960
Let's move.

08:01.960 --> 08:02.960
Yessir!

08:03.080 --> 08:05.330
Seriously, what's wrong with you?!

08:05.330 --> 08:06.830
Waltzing through the door with soggy pants?!

08:06.830 --> 08:07.960
Are you a child?!

08:07.960 --> 08:09.460
Oh, shuddup!

08:09.460 --> 08:11.750
It's not like I planned any of this, y'know.

08:12.040 --> 08:13.790
Hurry up and get changed!

08:13.790 --> 08:15.380
Is your underwear wet?

08:15.380 --> 08:16.540
No, it isn't!

08:16.540 --> 08:18.830
C-cut it out!
Quit tryin' to take my pants off!

08:18.830 --> 08:21.580
You can't possibly be comfortable
in these things!

08:21.580 --> 08:23.540
C'mon, I can start a load of laundry.

08:23.540 --> 08:25.880
Alright, fine! I'll take 'em off...

08:25.880 --> 08:27.250
Just look away, wouldja?!

08:27.250 --> 08:28.080
Huh?!

08:28.080 --> 08:30.580
Wh-why're you embarrassed all of a sudden?!

08:30.580 --> 08:33.500
You've worn nothing but boxers
since the day I first moved in!

08:33.500 --> 08:35.210
I still don't want you watchin'-

08:36.250 --> 08:37.710
A visitor...?

08:37.710 --> 08:40.420
Y'see? This is why you ought to hurry up and...

08:47.290 --> 08:48.380
Hide.

08:48.380 --> 08:49.960
B-but Hero...

08:49.960 --> 08:52.580
I sense extremely powerful magic
behind that door!

08:52.580 --> 08:53.790
Don't argue.

08:53.790 --> 08:56.250
You bein' here is only gonna
complicate things.

08:56.250 --> 08:57.500
Get outta here.

08:57.500 --> 08:58.710
Got it...

09:03.540 --> 09:05.080
Yeah, I heard ya!

09:05.080 --> 09:07.540
Gimme just a minute... oof.

09:10.960 --> 09:12.670
Oh, there you are.

09:13.040 --> 09:14.670
F-Fred...?!

09:15.040 --> 09:17.670
Hiya. It's been a while.

09:17.670 --> 09:20.710
Good to see you again... Max.

09:23.630 --> 09:25.630
The hell's this all about?

09:25.630 --> 09:28.460
Whaddya want from me? It's been years...

09:28.460 --> 09:31.000
Aw, that's no way to greet your ol' pal!

09:31.000 --> 09:32.830
We're buddies, aren't we?

09:33.130 --> 09:35.380
I felt nostalgic, so I thought I'd drop by.

09:35.380 --> 09:37.170
And you brought your flunkies?

09:37.170 --> 09:40.080
I happened to be in the area for work.

09:40.080 --> 09:42.500
Look, I'll make it quick, alright?

09:44.710 --> 09:46.790
Ah, don't worry.

09:46.790 --> 09:48.790
I intend to have them wait outside.

09:49.080 --> 09:51.250
Go take a break, you two.

09:51.250 --> 09:52.330
Yessir!

09:52.710 --> 09:53.880
That's better, right?

09:53.880 --> 09:56.330
Two friends having a chat every once in a while.

09:56.330 --> 09:59.080
Where's the harm in that?

10:03.960 --> 10:06.670
It's on you for not callin' ahead.

10:07.040 --> 10:11.290
Wasn't exactly prepared to entertain
the Chief Secretary of the Magic Bureau.

10:12.250 --> 10:15.460
I'm just an ordinary guy
when I'm amongst friends.

10:17.630 --> 10:19.750
You've got this place all neat and tidy.

10:19.750 --> 10:24.130
Huh... I remember you being more of
a slob when we were younger.

10:26.750 --> 10:28.830
Blazebringer, the Holy Blade!

10:28.830 --> 10:31.580
Don't just leave it on the floor like that...

10:31.580 --> 10:33.750
Ain't got a use for it.

10:33.750 --> 10:37.580
Well, maybe not having a weapon
would be for the best...

10:38.330 --> 10:41.170
Why not store it in that closet
over there or something?

10:41.170 --> 10:44.630
'Cause I ain't got space for that
big-ass thing in there.

10:44.630 --> 10:46.210
Oh, that makes sense...

10:46.210 --> 10:49.500
Wouldja spit it out already?
Why're you here?

10:50.000 --> 10:54.670
And how'd you even know
my current address in the first place?

10:56.290 --> 10:58.710
Good times, am I right?

10:59.630 --> 11:04.330
Brings back memories of our fight
against the demons ten years ago.

11:04.330 --> 11:07.250
Are ya gonna answer my question or not?

11:07.250 --> 11:09.710
Oh, just let me reminisce!

11:09.710 --> 11:13.670
Wasn't there a time when we had to
slip through their defenses?

11:13.670 --> 11:16.750
My Magic Shroud Circle
came in handy back then.

11:16.750 --> 11:18.210
Remember?

11:18.210 --> 11:22.170
It's a spell that prevents those on the outside
from perceiving those on the inside.

11:33.880 --> 11:35.460
Okay, fine.

11:35.460 --> 11:38.170
I suppose that's enough reminiscing for now.

11:40.460 --> 11:44.040
I wanted to discuss
the Gamma Republic situation.

11:46.040 --> 11:47.920
The Gamma Republic...

11:48.250 --> 11:50.830
A new country formed three years ago

11:50.830 --> 11:53.670
by Leo the Warrior when he
defected from the Kingdom.

11:52.710 --> 11:54.500
<b>The series of events that led to</b>

11:52.710 --> 11:54.500
<b>Leo the Warrior's defection from the Kingdom</b>

11:52.710 --> 11:54.500
<b>Compiled by Zenia</b>

11:54.750 --> 11:57.830
They claim to be a republic,

11:57.830 --> 12:01.880
but they're a terrorist organization illegally
occupying land that belongs to the Kingdom.

12:01.880 --> 12:06.130
Their moron of a leader assembled
all the traitors and criminals who defected,

12:06.130 --> 12:09.250
and their military has shown
a concerning level of growth.

12:09.710 --> 12:12.630
At this rate, the Kingdom will be
thrown into turmoil.

12:13.000 --> 12:16.380
And you know as well as I do, Max...

12:16.380 --> 12:18.790
that Leo's nothing short of ruthless in battle.

12:18.790 --> 12:21.580
Are ya sayin' we're on the brink of war?

12:21.580 --> 12:25.000
Former comrades forced to fight
against one another...?!

12:25.460 --> 12:28.500
It's not like they're going to show up
on our doorstep tomorrow.

12:28.500 --> 12:31.080
But we're bound to cross swords eventually.

12:31.080 --> 12:33.500
So we ought to prepare ourselves, right?

12:33.500 --> 12:34.960
Makes sense.

12:34.960 --> 12:37.460
Good luck if ya plan on fightin'.

12:38.880 --> 12:40.670
You know, don't you?

12:40.670 --> 12:42.630
What I'm about to ask.

12:46.830 --> 12:48.580
Fight alongside me.

12:48.580 --> 12:51.130
With your help, we can stop Leo.

12:55.670 --> 12:57.040
Please.

12:57.380 --> 13:00.000
And if you join the Royal Army,

13:00.000 --> 13:03.750
we can bring a swift end to this dispute
with the Gamma Republic.

13:04.500 --> 13:09.580
In fact, Leo might even decide to surrender
before it turns into a full-blown war.

13:09.580 --> 13:14.210
The longer the fighting drags on,
the greater the casualties on both sides.

13:14.210 --> 13:16.630
I don't want to shed more blood than necessary!

13:16.630 --> 13:18.960
Not ours, NOR theirs...

13:19.580 --> 13:22.960
Please... I need your help, Max!

13:24.420 --> 13:27.000
I'm retired.

13:27.000 --> 13:30.500
I couldn't keep up with
a buncha soldiers if I tried...

13:30.500 --> 13:33.130
Plus, my back's been givin' me problems lately.

13:33.130 --> 13:36.670
Sorry, but fightin' Leo ain't in the cards.

13:37.210 --> 13:39.460
I'm asking BECAUSE you're retired!

13:39.880 --> 13:44.380
If you cooperate with the Royal Army,
you're guaranteed a higher rank.

13:44.380 --> 13:47.170
It's the perfect chance
to get back in the game!

13:47.500 --> 13:49.750
Your savings must be nearly gone by now!

13:56.040 --> 13:59.830
A man of your stature doesn't belong
in a tiny shithole like this!

14:00.460 --> 14:02.670
Yer givin' me too much credit, Fred.

14:02.920 --> 14:05.710
This is what my life has amounted to.

14:05.710 --> 14:08.130
I wasn't destined for success like you guys.

14:08.130 --> 14:11.040
Sorry, but I ain't playin' ball.

14:11.040 --> 14:12.830
Ask someone else.

14:13.170 --> 14:15.540
You have qualms about fighting an ex-friend.

14:15.540 --> 14:17.540
Is that it?

14:18.670 --> 14:21.170
Do I look like someone
with morals to you?

14:21.170 --> 14:22.880
It's a pain in the ass!

14:22.880 --> 14:27.460
For the Kingdom, for the Republic,
for the people...

14:27.460 --> 14:29.170
All bullshit.

14:29.170 --> 14:32.170
I've had enough. Go home.

14:34.040 --> 14:37.000
I see... That's too bad, Max.

14:37.380 --> 14:38.920
Oh well...

14:38.920 --> 14:41.290
At least see me out, wouldja, Max?

14:42.330 --> 14:44.420
Thank goodness, he's leaving...

14:44.420 --> 14:47.040
I swear, he scared the bejesus outta me...

14:47.670 --> 14:49.250
That reminds me...

14:49.250 --> 14:51.880
You've been awfully busy lately, haven't you?

14:52.670 --> 14:54.210
Whaddya mean...?

14:54.790 --> 14:56.580
Don't play dumb.

14:56.580 --> 14:58.580
I saw the video.

14:59.000 --> 15:02.460
You were playing tag with a woman
in her birthday suit, right?

15:03.790 --> 15:06.210
You're going to get yourself in trouble!

15:06.210 --> 15:09.580
Save the naked hijinks for
INSIDE the bedroom.

15:09.580 --> 15:11.710
Thanks for the advice.

15:11.710 --> 15:13.830
So where'dja meet her?

15:13.830 --> 15:15.420
The voluptuous vixen, I mean.

15:15.420 --> 15:18.130
Does it matter? It's not a big deal...

15:18.130 --> 15:21.170
Oh, I'd say it matters very much.

15:21.750 --> 15:25.380
I wonder why you're hanging out
with a demon woman...

15:25.830 --> 15:29.960
Ordinary people might not have noticed,
but you can't fool me.

15:30.210 --> 15:31.630
I'm right, aren't I?

15:31.630 --> 15:35.250
We killed tons of 'em together
ten years ago...

15:35.580 --> 15:37.460
What're you implying?

15:37.710 --> 15:40.420
I don't give a rat's ass whether
you're involved with the demons.

15:40.420 --> 15:42.830
It doesn't matter to me anymore.

15:42.830 --> 15:46.040
If you can coexist with 'em,
then more power to you.

15:46.540 --> 15:48.750
But what will others think?

15:48.750 --> 15:52.630
It'd be the scandal of the century.
The media would have a field day.

15:54.250 --> 15:56.250
"The Hero, Sleeping with a Demon?!"

15:54.250 --> 15:59.670
<b>Special Emergency Report</b>

15:54.250 --> 15:59.670
<b>FREE DAY</b>

15:54.250 --> 15:59.670
<b>Max the Hero,</b>

15:54.250 --> 15:59.670
<b>Sleeping with a Demon?!</b>

15:56.250 --> 15:57.790
"A Betrayer of Humanity!"

15:57.790 --> 15:59.670
Once the public finds out about it,

15:59.920 --> 16:03.670
you could be branded a traitor,
just like Leo...

16:03.830 --> 16:06.920
Are you insinuatin' that
that woman is a demon?

16:06.920 --> 16:09.250
That couldn't be further from the truth.

16:09.250 --> 16:10.630
Relax.

16:10.630 --> 16:14.170
Nobody knows, not even my staff.
I'm the only one who knows...

16:14.670 --> 16:16.080
...for now.

16:16.880 --> 16:18.880
Think it over carefully...

16:19.630 --> 16:21.580
Return to the hero life?

16:21.580 --> 16:23.500
Or become a wanted man?

16:24.040 --> 16:29.330
Ya got any proof of me
bein' involved with the demons?

16:29.330 --> 16:32.000
'Cause ya can't just talk outta yer ass
based on a hunch.

16:32.210 --> 16:36.040
Max... I do wish you wouldn't
underestimate me.

16:38.330 --> 16:43.630
It's too late to try and hide the evil aura
emanating from the inside of your closet.

16:43.630 --> 16:44.710
Not to mention...

16:44.710 --> 16:47.920
...compared to what I saw in that video,
this is much more...

16:47.920 --> 16:49.210
...sinister.

16:54.380 --> 16:56.460
I'll just take a quick peek.

16:59.330 --> 17:00.830
Fine, whatever.

17:00.830 --> 17:02.670
Open it if ya want.

17:19.750 --> 17:21.830
Fred? What's wrong?

17:22.170 --> 17:24.330
Max, have you...

17:24.630 --> 17:28.290
...noticed anything strange
in the time that you've lived here?

17:28.290 --> 17:30.580
Huh? "Strange"?

17:30.580 --> 17:32.380
Whaddya mean, "strange"?

17:32.380 --> 17:34.170
What do you mean, "what do you mean"?!

17:34.170 --> 17:35.710
Th..this isn't-

17:36.290 --> 17:38.630
The hell's gotten into you?

17:39.000 --> 17:41.080
Ya look pale as a ghost. You good?

17:41.080 --> 17:43.210
I-I gotta get going...

17:43.210 --> 17:44.330
Sorry...

17:44.330 --> 17:45.830
Huh? Oh, okay.

17:45.830 --> 17:47.250
No, it's fine! Stay back!

17:47.250 --> 17:49.250
What's with you, dude?
Yer actin' weird...

17:49.250 --> 17:51.250
Y-you're the weird one here!

17:51.250 --> 17:52.250
Bye!

17:52.250 --> 17:55.130
N-no way... Oh god, oh god, oh god...

17:55.130 --> 17:58.080
Oh, this is bad... Really, really bad!

17:58.080 --> 17:59.710
What's his deal...?

17:59.960 --> 18:02.880
Well, I guess that means... we're safe?

18:04.330 --> 18:06.000
Is he gone?

18:06.000 --> 18:07.960
Whew, that was a close one...

18:08.210 --> 18:11.040
Did you do somethin' to scare Fred?

18:11.040 --> 18:13.960
Huh? No, I didn't do anything.

18:14.290 --> 18:16.460
I was hiding in one of the futons in the back.

18:16.460 --> 18:18.710
And thanks to my brilliant
powers of deception,

18:18.710 --> 18:20.210
we managed not to get caught!

18:21.170 --> 18:23.000
Are you sure that's what happened...?

18:23.420 --> 18:25.040
Huh, oh well...

18:26.790 --> 18:28.580
I'm beat!

18:29.040 --> 18:30.170
Max...

18:30.750 --> 18:32.380
Your friends, they're...

18:32.380 --> 18:33.540
Don't start.

18:33.830 --> 18:36.250
They've got their lives, and I've got mine.

18:36.250 --> 18:38.750
This ain't somethin' I can help 'em with.

18:39.000 --> 18:40.170
Ah...

18:40.580 --> 18:42.420
I suppose you're right...

18:42.960 --> 18:45.170
Also, please forgive me.

18:45.170 --> 18:48.580
It's my fault that you ended up
in such a precarious position...

18:48.580 --> 18:50.250
Yeah, I'll say!

18:50.250 --> 18:52.540
Yer nothin' but trouble, I swear...

18:53.210 --> 18:56.830
They left me alone this time,
but if worst comes to worst,

18:56.830 --> 18:59.170
I might actually end up
havin' to leave the Kingdom...

18:59.170 --> 19:02.000
In that case, you can come live at my castle!

19:06.460 --> 19:10.210
Then I'd REALLY be a "betrayer of humanity"...

19:11.540 --> 19:13.130
Mr. Secretary!

19:13.130 --> 19:15.500
What's the matter? Sir, are you alright?

19:17.170 --> 19:18.880
I-I'm fine...

19:20.250 --> 19:22.540
Oh no... The Hero didn't attack you, did he?

19:22.540 --> 19:24.460
N-no, that's not...

19:24.460 --> 19:26.420
R-regardless, let's just go.

19:26.420 --> 19:28.960
Take me home, wouldja?
Not back to the office...

19:28.960 --> 19:32.960
Sorry, sir. You've got a meeting on
the magical reactor construction project.

19:32.960 --> 19:34.540
Dammit...

19:37.710 --> 19:40.080
You're not off the hook yet, Max.

19:40.080 --> 19:42.920
I WILL convince you to help me eventually...

19:43.210 --> 19:46.040
It's in your own best interest, too.

19:46.420 --> 19:48.750
But I'm never going back to that apartment!

19:48.750 --> 19:52.460
Mr. Secretary, would you mind
at least trying to walk...?

19:59.920 --> 20:01.330
Was that all of them...?

20:02.880 --> 20:03.880
WATCH OUT!

21:09.540 --> 21:12.670
Y'know... Yer not half bad!

21:13.460 --> 21:15.130
Name's Leo. Nice to meetcha.

21:17.210 --> 21:19.540
Like you said, I'm a phony cleric.

21:19.540 --> 21:21.880
I've been pawning these crappy talismans
off on the congregation

21:21.880 --> 21:24.460
and swindling them out of their money.

21:24.460 --> 21:26.670
And now the cat's outta the bag.

21:27.000 --> 21:29.040
I can't stay in this town anymore...

21:29.040 --> 21:32.880
But you went to great lengths to protect them
in a different way, didn't you?

21:33.960 --> 21:37.000
Erecting a barrier that shields
the whole town?

21:37.000 --> 21:38.420
You've got skills.

21:38.880 --> 21:40.920
Wait, YOU'RE the one who did that?!

21:40.920 --> 21:43.750
No freakin' way! Dude, that's awesome!

21:44.210 --> 21:45.750
Wanna come with us?

21:47.000 --> 21:48.710
My name's Max...

21:49.080 --> 21:50.420
What's yours?

21:52.670 --> 21:53.880
Fred.

21:54.540 --> 21:57.540
Now that's a REAL cleric... eh, Fred?
